{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"NIFTY 500 Quantitative Prediction Engine & Trading Intelligence API","description":"\n# NIFTY 500 Quantitative AI Engine & Prediction API\n\nAn automated quantitative trading and market intelligence backend targeting exclusively the **NIFTY 500** universe on the National Stock Exchange of India (NSE).\n\n### Key Architectural Capabilities:\n- **SQLite Database with WAL Mode**: High-concurrency Write-Ahead Logging allows continuous, non-blocking API reads during daily background updates.\n- **Incremental Trailing Ingestion**: Only missing trailing bars are downloaded, saving network bandwidth and avoiding rate limits.\n- **64+ Engineered Indicators**: ATR, Normalized ATR, Historical Volatility, RSI 14, MACD Histogram, Bollinger Bands, MAs (20, 50, 200), Pivot Points ($P, R_1, S_1$), and ADX 14.\n- **Persistent ML Ensembles**: Dedicated models per stock (`Ridge` + `LogisticRegression` with `RobustScaler`) saved in `models_registry/` for low-latency inference.\n- **Automated Scheduling**: APScheduler configured to run Monday–Friday at 16:00 IST (market close).\n","version":"2.0.0"},"paths":{"/api/stocks":{"get":{"tags":["NIFTY 500 Directory"],"summary":"List all NIFTY 500 Constituents","description":"Returns the complete directory of NIFTY 500 stocks stored in SQLite,\nincluding latest price, market cap, day change %, and machine learning trend forecast.","operationId":"list_stocks_api_stocks_get","parameters":[{"name":"query","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Search by ticker symbol or company name (e.g. 'RELIANCE', 'TATA', 'HDFC')","title":"Query"},"description":"Search by ticker symbol or company name (e.g. 'RELIANCE', 'TATA', 'HDFC')"},{"name":"sector","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Filter by sector / industry (e.g. 'Financial Services', 'Information Technology')","title":"Sector"},"description":"Filter by sector / industry (e.g. 'Financial Services', 'Information Technology')"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/StocksListResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/stock/{ticker}":{"get":{"tags":["Stock Analysis & Forecasting"],"summary":"Get Consolidated Stock Analytics & Forecast","description":"**Single-Shot Consolidated Endpoint**:\nRetrieves all essential analytics for a given stock from local SQLite storage:\n- **Fundamental Valuation**: Market Cap (₹ Cr), P/E, P/B, EPS, Dividend Yield, ROE, Sector, Industry.\n- **Technical Indicators**: RSI 14, MACD & Histogram, Bollinger Bands, Moving Averages (20, 50, 200), Pivot Levels (P, R1, S1), ATR 14, ADX 14.\n- **Tomorrow's ML Forecast**: Predicted Close Price (₹), Price Delta, Trading Range (Low - High), Bullish/Bearish Direction, Confidence Score (%).\n- **Historical Chart Bars**: Trailing 90 trading sessions with overlay technical indicators.\n\n*Note: If the stock is not yet cached in the SQLite database, it is dynamically bootstrapped on-the-fly.*","operationId":"get_stock_details_api_stock__ticker__get","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Stock ticker symbol (e.g. 'RELIANCE', 'TCS', 'AXISBANK.NS', 'NIFTY')","title":"Ticker"},"description":"Stock ticker symbol (e.g. 'RELIANCE', 'TCS', 'AXISBANK.NS', 'NIFTY')"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Full stock intelligence packet returned successfully","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/StockDetailResponse"}}}},"400":{"description":"Error bootstrapping stock data from provider"},"404":{"description":"Ticker symbol not found in universe"},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/market/analysis":{"get":{"tags":["Market Breadth & Scanner"],"summary":"Get Daily Market Breadth & Opportunity Scan","description":"Returns market-wide breadth and algorithmic opportunity scans across NIFTY 500:\n- **Market Breadth**: Advances vs Declines count.\n- **Trend Participation**: % of stocks above 50-day and 200-day Simple Moving Averages.\n- **Sector Performance**: Aggregated average returns across all NSE industry sectors.\n- **Top 10 Bullish Breakouts**: Ranked by predicted upside and model confidence.\n- **Top 10 Bearish Breakdowns**: Ranked by predicted downside risk.","operationId":"get_market_analysis_api_market_analysis_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Daily market analysis report retrieved","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MarketAnalysisResponse"}}}},"404":{"description":"No analysis report generated yet; run cron first"}}}},"/api/market/segmentation":{"get":{"tags":["Market Breadth & Scanner","Stock Analysis & Forecasting"],"summary":"Get Industry & Sentiment Segmentation Matrix","description":"**Comprehensive Industry & Sentiment Conviction Segmentation**:\nAnalyzes all stocks and machine learning models across the NIFTY 500 universe,\nsegmenting them into 6 distinct sentiment conviction bands across all industry sectors:\n\n### 🟢 Bullish Conviction Bands:\n- **Extreme Bullish**: High predicted upside (>= +1.5%) with strong ML model conviction (>= 68%).\n- **Medium Bullish**: Solid predicted upside (+0.4% to +1.5%).\n- **Mild Bullish**: Moderate upward drift (0.0% to +0.4%).\n\n### 🔴 Bearish Conviction Bands:\n- **Mild Bearish**: Modest downward drift (0.0% to -0.4%).\n- **Medium Bearish**: Moderate downside risk (-0.4% to -1.5%).\n- **Extreme Bearish**: Sharp predicted drop (<= -1.5%) with high model conviction (>= 68%).\n\nReturns universe-wide sentiment counts, industry-by-industry breakdowns, and filtered constituent stocks.","operationId":"get_market_segmentation_endpoint_api_market_segmentation_get","parameters":[{"name":"sector","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Filter stocks to a specific industry / sector (e.g. 'Financial Services', 'Healthcare')","title":"Sector"},"description":"Filter stocks to a specific industry / sector (e.g. 'Financial Services', 'Healthcare')"},{"name":"segment","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Filter by conviction band: 'extreme_bullish', 'medium_bullish', 'mild_bullish', 'mild_bearish', 'medium_bearish', 'extreme_bearish'","title":"Segment"},"description":"Filter by conviction band: 'extreme_bullish', 'medium_bullish', 'mild_bullish', 'mild_bearish', 'medium_bearish', 'extreme_bearish'"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MarketSegmentationResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/cron/run":{"post":{"tags":["Automated Trailing Cron"],"summary":"Trigger Trailing Ingestion Cron Job","description":"Triggers the incremental daily trailing workflow asynchronously in the background:\n1. Downloads only missing daily OHLCV bars across NIFTY 500 constituents.\n2. Recomputes technical indicators for the trailing 250 sessions.\n3. Incrementally retrains/updates ML models and regenerates tomorrow's forecasts.\n4. Computes daily market breadth, sector heat, and opportunity rankings.","operationId":"trigger_cron_manually_api_cron_run_post","responses":{"202":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CronRunResponse"}}}}}}},"/api/models/init-all":{"post":{"tags":["Model Training & Lifecycle"],"summary":"Initiate Creation of All 500 Logistic Regression Models","description":"**Batch-Initiate All 500 NIFTY Logistic Regression Models**:\n1. Ingests historical daily OHLCV bars up to today's latest session across NIFTY 500.\n2. Vectorizes 64+ technical indicators per stock (ATR 14, RSI 14, MACD, Bollinger Bands, SMAs).\n3. Fits a `LogisticRegression` classifier (with `RobustScaler` and `Ridge` price regressor) for every constituent using data up to today.\n4. Serializes models to `models_registry/{ticker}.joblib`.\n5. Generates forward predictions (price target, range, trend signal) into SQLite `predictions`.\n6. Recomputes market-wide breadth and sector scan.\n\n*Execution runs asynchronously in the background. Track live progress using `GET /api/models/status`.*","operationId":"initiate_all_models_api_models_init_all_post","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Limit number of stocks to process (e.g. 20 for rapid testing, or omit for all 501)","title":"Limit"},"description":"Limit number of stocks to process (e.g. 20 for rapid testing, or omit for all 501)"},{"name":"period","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Historical data period to ingest if missing","default":"5y","title":"Period"},"description":"Historical data period to ingest if missing"},{"name":"max_workers","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Worker threads for parallel training","default":8,"title":"Max Workers"},"description":"Worker threads for parallel training"},{"name":"force","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"Force start training even if a background task is marked running","default":false,"title":"Force"},"description":"Force start training even if a background task is marked running"}],"responses":{"202":{"description":"Batch model creation initiated in background","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ModelInitResponse"}}}},"409":{"description":"Another training or top-up job is currently running"},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/models/topup-and-update":{"post":{"tags":["Model Training & Lifecycle"],"summary":"Top Up Today's Latest Data & Update Model(s)","description":"**Trailing Incremental Data Top-Up & Model Refit**:\n1. Checks the latest recorded bar `MAX(date)` for the targeted stock(s).\n2. Downloads **only today's latest missing daily bar(s)** from Yahoo Finance (zero redundant re-downloads).\n3. Appends new bars into SQLite `daily_ohlcv`.\n4. Recalculates technical indicators with today's new closing price, volume, and range.\n5. Refits/updates the `LogisticRegression` (+ `Ridge`) model with today's latest data.\n6. Produces updated forward forecast for the next trading session.\n7. Updates universe breadth and sector performance metrics.","operationId":"topup_and_update_models_api_models_topup_and_update_post","parameters":[{"name":"ticker","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Specific ticker symbol (e.g. 'RELIANCE', 'TCS.NS'). If omitted, tops up all 500 NIFTY constituents.","title":"Ticker"},"description":"Specific ticker symbol (e.g. 'RELIANCE', 'TCS.NS'). If omitted, tops up all 500 NIFTY constituents."},{"name":"background","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"Run in background (recommended when updating all 500 stocks)","default":false,"title":"Background"},"description":"Run in background (recommended when updating all 500 stocks)"},{"name":"max_workers","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","description":"Thread concurrency","default":8,"title":"Max Workers"},"description":"Thread concurrency"},{"name":"force","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"Force run top-up even if another task is marked active","default":false,"title":"Force"},"description":"Force run top-up even if another task is marked active"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ModelTopupResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/models/reset-status":{"post":{"tags":["Model Training & Lifecycle"],"summary":"Reset Training Status to Idle","description":"Forces the batch manager status back to idle if needed.","operationId":"reset_models_status_api_models_reset_status_post","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/models/status":{"get":{"tags":["Model Training & Lifecycle"],"summary":"Get Real-Time Model Training Status & Progress","description":"Returns real-time operational status and progress of batch training or daily top-up:\n- `task_type`: Active task identifier (`init_all_models`, `topup_and_update`, `idle`).\n- `status`: Execution state (`idle`, `running`, `completed`, `failed`).\n- `progress_pct`: Percentage completed (0.0 to 100.0%).\n- `completed_stocks`: Count of successfully trained models.\n- `failed_stocks`: Count of stocks with errors or insufficient data.\n- `current_ticker`: Currently processing stock symbol.\n- `elapsed_seconds`: Execution duration so far.","operationId":"get_models_status_api_models_status_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ModelStatusResponse"}}}}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"ChartBarModel":{"properties":{"date":{"type":"string","title":"Date","example":"2026-10-01"},"open":{"type":"number","title":"Open","example":1160.0},"high":{"type":"number","title":"High","example":1175.5},"low":{"type":"number","title":"Low","example":1158.2},"close":{"type":"number","title":"Close","example":1167.7},"volume":{"type":"number","title":"Volume","example":8450000.0},"sma_20":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Sma 20","example":1180.2},"sma_50":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Sma 50","example":1210.4},"bb_upper":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Bb Upper","example":1220.4},"bb_lower":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Bb Lower","example":1140.0},"bb_middle":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Bb Middle","example":1180.2}},"type":"object","required":["date","open","high","low","close","volume"],"title":"ChartBarModel"},"CronRunResponse":{"properties":{"status":{"type":"string","title":"Status","default":"triggered","example":"triggered"},"message":{"type":"string","title":"Message","example":"Trailing daily cron worker launched in background."}},"type":"object","required":["message"],"title":"CronRunResponse"},"FundamentalsModel":{"properties":{"ticker":{"type":"string","title":"Ticker","example":"RELIANCE.NS"},"company_name":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Company Name","example":"Reliance Industries Ltd."},"sector":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Sector","example":"Oil Gas & Consumable Fuels"},"industry":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Industry","example":"Refining & Marketing"},"market_cap":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Market Cap","description":"Market Cap in ₹ Crores","example":1850000.0},"pe_ratio":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Pe Ratio","description":"Trailing Price-to-Earnings Ratio","example":24.5},"pb_ratio":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Pb Ratio","description":"Price-to-Book Ratio","example":2.8},"eps":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Eps","description":"Trailing Twelve Months EPS in ₹","example":48.2},"dividend_yield":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Dividend Yield","description":"Annual Dividend Yield (%)","example":0.85},"roe":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Roe","description":"Return on Equity (%)","example":12.4},"last_fundamental_update":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Last Fundamental Update","example":"2026-10-03 16:30:00"}},"type":"object","required":["ticker"],"title":"FundamentalsModel"},"HTTPValidationError":{"properties":{"detail":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationError"},"type":"array","title":"Detail"}},"type":"object","title":"HTTPValidationError"},"MarketAnalysisResponse":{"properties":{"status":{"type":"string","title":"Status","default":"success","example":"success"},"market_analysis":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Market Analysis","example":{"advances":285,"date":"2026-10-01","declines":215,"pct_above_sma200":74.8,"pct_above_sma50":62.4,"sector_performance":{"Financial Services":0.85,"Information Technology":1.2},"top_bearish_tickers":[{"confidence_pct":61.1,"expected_pct_change":-2.1,"ticker":"TMCV.NS","trend_signal":"BEARISH"}],"top_bullish_tickers":[{"confidence_pct":66.9,"expected_pct_change":1.14,"ticker":"TCS.NS","trend_signal":"BULLISH"}]}}},"type":"object","required":["market_analysis"],"title":"MarketAnalysisResponse"},"MarketSegmentationResponse":{"properties":{"status":{"type":"string","title":"Status","default":"success","example":"success"},"total_stocks":{"type":"integer","title":"Total Stocks","example":501},"total_bullish":{"type":"integer","title":"Total Bullish","example":260},"total_bearish":{"type":"integer","title":"Total Bearish","example":241},"sentiment_counts":{"additionalProperties":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SegmentSentimentItem"},"type":"object","title":"Sentiment Counts"},"sectors":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SectorConvictionItem"},"type":"array","title":"Sectors"},"stocks_count":{"type":"integer","title":"Stocks Count","example":501},"stocks":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SegmentedStockItem"},"type":"array","title":"Stocks"}},"type":"object","required":["total_stocks","total_bullish","total_bearish","sentiment_counts","sectors","stocks_count","stocks"],"title":"MarketSegmentationResponse"},"ModelInitResponse":{"properties":{"status":{"type":"string","title":"Status","example":"initiated"},"task":{"type":"string","title":"Task","default":"init_all_models","example":"init_all_models"},"message":{"type":"string","title":"Message","example":"Batch creation of all 500 Logistic Regression models started."},"total_stocks":{"type":"integer","title":"Total Stocks","description":"Total number of constituent stocks queued for training","example":501},"check_status_url":{"type":"string","title":"Check Status Url","description":"Polling endpoint for real-time progress","default":"/api/models/status","example":"/api/models/status"}},"type":"object","required":["status","message","total_stocks"],"title":"ModelInitResponse"},"ModelStatusResponse":{"properties":{"task_type":{"type":"string","title":"Task Type","description":"Active task identifier (init_all_models, topup_and_update, idle)","example":"init_all_models"},"status":{"type":"string","title":"Status","description":"Operational status: idle, running, completed, failed","example":"running"},"progress_pct":{"type":"number","title":"Progress Pct","description":"Completion progress percentage (0.0 to 100.0%)","example":42.5},"total_stocks":{"type":"integer","title":"Total Stocks","description":"Total constituents in scope","example":501},"completed_stocks":{"type":"integer","title":"Completed Stocks","description":"Models successfully fitted and saved","example":213},"failed_stocks":{"type":"integer","title":"Failed Stocks","description":"Stocks with errors or insufficient trading history","example":2},"current_ticker":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Current Ticker","description":"Stock currently undergoing training/top-up","example":"INFY.NS"},"started_at":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Started At","description":"Start timestamp","example":"2026-10-03T22:45:00"},"completed_at":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Completed At","description":"Finish timestamp","example":"2026-10-03T22:48:30"},"elapsed_seconds":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Elapsed Seconds","description":"Elapsed execution seconds","example":45.2},"message":{"type":"string","title":"Message","example":"Training models in progress..."},"details":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Details","description":"Detailed execution metrics and results"}},"type":"object","required":["task_type","status","progress_pct","total_stocks","completed_stocks","failed_stocks","message"],"title":"ModelStatusResponse"},"ModelTopupResponse":{"properties":{"status":{"type":"string","title":"Status","default":"success","example":"success"},"message":{"type":"string","title":"Message","example":"Today's data topped up and models updated successfully."},"updated_tickers_count":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Updated Tickers Count","description":"Constituents evaluated for top-up","example":501},"new_bars_count":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"New Bars Count","description":"Total new OHLCV daily bars ingested","example":501},"predictions_count":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Predictions Count","description":"New forward predictions generated","example":501},"elapsed_seconds":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Elapsed Seconds","description":"Execution duration in seconds","example":12.4},"ticker":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Ticker","description":"Specific ticker if single-stock top-up","example":"RELIANCE.NS"},"latest_prediction":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Latest Prediction","description":"Forward prediction if single-stock top-up"}},"type":"object","required":["message"],"title":"ModelTopupResponse"},"OHLCVModel":{"properties":{"ticker":{"type":"string","title":"Ticker","example":"RELIANCE.NS"},"date":{"type":"string","title":"Date","example":"2026-10-01"},"open":{"type":"number","title":"Open","example":1160.0},"high":{"type":"number","title":"High","example":1175.5},"low":{"type":"number","title":"Low","example":1158.2},"close":{"type":"number","title":"Close","example":1167.7},"volume":{"type":"number","title":"Volume","example":8450000.0}},"type":"object","required":["ticker","date","open","high","low","close","volume"],"title":"OHLCVModel"},"PredictionModel":{"properties":{"ticker":{"type":"string","title":"Ticker","example":"RELIANCE.NS"},"date":{"type":"string","title":"Date","description":"As-of historical date","example":"2026-10-01"},"target_date":{"type":"string","title":"Target Date","description":"Forecast target trading session","example":"2026-10-03"},"reference_close":{"type":"number","title":"Reference Close","description":"Current reference price","example":1167.7},"predicted_close":{"type":"number","title":"Predicted Close","description":"Predicted target close price in ₹","example":1172.02},"expected_pct_change":{"type":"number","title":"Expected Pct Change","description":"Expected percentage change","example":0.37},"range_low":{"type":"number","title":"Range Low","description":"Expected lower price bound (ATR based)","example":1161.97},"range_high":{"type":"number","title":"Range High","description":"Expected upper price bound (ATR based)","example":1182.06},"trend_signal":{"type":"string","title":"Trend Signal","description":"Trend Direction: BULLISH or BEARISH","example":"BULLISH"},"confidence_pct":{"type":"number","title":"Confidence Pct","description":"Model probability confidence (%)","example":70.7},"champion_model":{"type":"string","title":"Champion Model","description":"Champion ML model identifier","example":"Ridge+LogReg"}},"type":"object","required":["ticker","date","target_date","reference_close","predicted_close","expected_pct_change","range_low","range_high","trend_signal","confidence_pct","champion_model"],"title":"PredictionModel"},"SectorConvictionItem":{"properties":{"sector":{"type":"string","title":"Sector","example":"Financial Services"},"total_stocks":{"type":"integer","title":"Total Stocks","example":98},"bullish_count":{"type":"integer","title":"Bullish Count","example":53},"bearish_count":{"type":"integer","title":"Bearish Count","example":45},"bullish_pct":{"type":"number","title":"Bullish Pct","example":54.1},"bearish_pct":{"type":"number","title":"Bearish Pct","example":45.9},"bias":{"type":"string","title":"Bias","example":"BULLISH_LEAN"},"counts":{"additionalProperties":{"type":"integer"},"type":"object","title":"Counts","example":{"extreme_bearish":3,"extreme_bullish":5,"medium_bearish":16,"medium_bullish":21,"mild_bearish":26,"mild_bullish":27}}},"type":"object","required":["sector","total_stocks","bullish_count","bearish_count","bullish_pct","bearish_pct","bias","counts"],"title":"SectorConvictionItem"},"SegmentSentimentItem":{"properties":{"count":{"type":"integer","title":"Count","example":30},"pct":{"type":"number","title":"Pct","example":6.0},"label":{"type":"string","title":"Label","example":"Extreme Bullish"},"color":{"type":"string","title":"Color","example":"#00e5ff"},"description":{"type":"string","title":"Description","example":"High predicted upside (>= +1.5%) with strong ML model conviction"}},"type":"object","required":["count","pct","label","color","description"],"title":"SegmentSentimentItem"},"SegmentedStockItem":{"properties":{"ticker":{"type":"string","title":"Ticker","example":"TCS.NS"},"company_name":{"type":"string","title":"Company Name","example":"Tata Consultancy Services Ltd."},"sector":{"type":"string","title":"Sector","example":"Information Technology"},"industry":{"type":"string","title":"Industry","example":"Computers - Software & Consulting"},"close":{"type":"number","title":"Close","example":2075.0},"predicted_close":{"type":"number","title":"Predicted Close","example":2110.5},"expected_pct_